{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>配備 OLED 螢幕的新款 14 吋及 16 吋 MacBook Pro 重新加入發光 Apple 標誌，這項十年前被淘汰的設計正式回歸。YouTuber Judner Aura 在其 YouTube 頻道 UrAvgConsumer 的實機上手影片中展示了這個標誌。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"文章配圖\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"720\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Maxresdefault-7.jpg\" width=\"1280\"/></figure>\n<h2>發光標誌亮度隨螢幕聯動</h2>\n<p>影片顯示，這個標誌的亮度與 MacBook Pro 的螢幕亮度連動：調高螢幕亮度，標誌便會更光亮，反之亦然。舊款 MacBook 的發光標誌亦以相同方式運作。</p>\n<p>Apple 從未公開解釋為何移除發光標誌，但許多客戶長期希望這項設計回歸，而公司顯然已聽取意見。新款 MacBook Pro 現已接受預訂，並於 11 月 6 日星期五發售。</p>\n<figure><p>\n</p></figure>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T22:40:51.115018+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":314,"images":1,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T22:33:56+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T23:18:51.398684+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T22:38:32.279043+00:00","content_hash":"285e4b7cc9e7e805213e03f1202da03b7953fad815fb64786d9f4b94b7311ca1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}